# Fugitive Droid counters only a spell that targets an artifact or creature its controller controls. On turn 2 Bot2 casts
# Lightning Bolt at Bot1's face: refused, the Droid stays and Bot1 takes 3. On turn 3 Bot1 casts a Lightning Bolt at Bot2's
# Grizzly Bears: refused as well (the Bears are the opponent's), and the Bears die.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Mox Sapphire
Mox Ruby
Fugitive Droid
Lightning Bolt
Island x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Lightning Bolt
Mox Emerald
Grizzly Bears
Island x16

